@phosphor-icons/core 2.1.1, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Phosphor Icons.
See LICENSE in this directory.
https://github.com/phosphor-icons/core

Modifications: fill="currentColor" is replaced with #ffffff so the icons can be
tinted at paint time. duo/<name>.svg holds only the opacity="0.2" back layer of
duotone/<name>-duotone.svg, with the opacity attribute removed.

regular/crown-simple.svg carries a data-glyph attribute because the Phosphor
font has no glyph of that name; its inline-text glyph borrows USER_GEAR.
